XBoing: the keys
================

The mouse moves the paddle; any mouse button launches the ball and fires
bullets. G switches between the mouse and the keys (or start with -keys).

In a game:

  Space         launch the ball         K          shoot
  Left or J     paddle left             Right or L paddle right
  P             pause, and go on        T          tilt the board
  D             lose the ball in play
  Z             save the game           X          load the saved game
  Esc           end the game

On the title and attract screens:

  H             high scores (Shift H your own)
  S             visual effects on or off
  W             the starting level
  C             the next attract screen
  1 to 9        game speed (9 is fastest)

Any time:

  A             sound on or off         + and -    louder, quieter
  I             window or full screen
  E             the level editor
  Q             quit

The keys every AmiCradle game has on Right Amiga (GFOpenUp's SDL2.module):
Right Amiga + F window or full screen, + P pause, + Q quit, + M free the
mouse pointer, + S a screenshot in the drawer's Screenshots, and Help
shows this file.
